Pigmee Tech — Licensing Overview
=================================

Pigmee Tech (mod id: `pigtech`) is an unofficial Minecraft 1.12.2 / Cleanroom
port of the pigmee subsystem of AE2 Lightning Tech (AE2LT). It uses a
multi-license structure: different portions of the project are governed by
different licenses, and this overview does not replace the complete license
texts in the LICENSES directory.

