--------------

License: GNU Lesser General Public License version 3.0 or later
(SPDX: LGPL-3.0-or-later)

Applies to:
- Source code under src/main/java/
- Source-derived scripts and implementation files, unless a file carries a
  different license notice

Original pigmee implementation (AE2 Lightning Tech, 1.21.1):
