- Copyright (c) 2026 CystrySU
- Copyright (c) 2026 gjmhmm8
- Copyright (c) 2026 _leng
- Copyright (c) 2026 TedXenon
- Copyright (c) 2026 MHanHanBing

Minecraft 1.12.2 port and subsequent modifications:
- Copyright (c) 2026 KleinBlue

AE2-derived portions remain subject to their original copyright and license:
- Copyright (c) 2013-2020 AlgorithmX2 et al.
- GNU Lesser General Public License version 3.0

The complete LGPL-3.0 license text is available at:
- LICENSES/LGPL-3.0.txt

