3. Other third-party material
-----------------------------

Third-party files retain their original copyright and license notices. This
project does not relicense third-party material. The primary upstream sources
are:

- AE2 Lightning Tech (AE2LT)
  https://modrinth.com/mod/ae2-lightning-tech
